    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54c879346882707fd761ac26",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最大方针！特雷森学园标榜的，\n就是“赛马娘优先主义”！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "400522b02a08758fcffd70410c36340a4e9f3ce2b6cc59c6f33d119dd7ad9da0",
