      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "逃避你本该挑战的事物而已，不是吗？\n要在这条荆棘的王道上前进，\n除了要伤害自己，有时也要伤害赛马娘才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1cc8cce792da39bb72bf4bc5a90b57e82083d2b22aae34ae7c8c95b7739d772",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
