    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d2750c4694107441f1be312",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我只是闭上眼，咬牙忍耐着。\n我怎么有办法面对，\n这束手无策的现实……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d79217e27c966d30acc870ae0e4216d8bea572a1d94a9cf0ca168c41b4601823",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
