      "uid": "zhcn:297330af8078936ead31f3e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我整个身体悬到了半空！然后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e474ca4f10e2b6bf88ae79e42620bb28d4eb6c81730cfaa1d32fb9b7fc00e5b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86200b3eedfc3653c621696f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我回想起秋川理事长所说的话。\n训练的基础──\n就是要尊重赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09e1ec830de54eba32cae502f003bf6d7141bc0909c1b8b7917de6786e59e49a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760ecf9368a266d241f74ed7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旋转了一圈，背部朝下摔了下去！\n轻微撞击感传到身上，使我不禁睁开了眼睛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1af2dbd6ca5368d94ef06f58cdf57ca8e47c5a23ebf69b78826e6cdd06b92613",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
